# Normalise line endings to LF in both the repository and the working tree.
#
# The machine-wide git config sets core.autocrlf=true, so with no attributes
# Git would check text files out as CRLF; every LF working copy (agent/Claude
# edits, this repo's index) then triggers "LF will be replaced by CRLF" on add
# and gets silently rewritten on the next checkout.  Stating eol=lf here makes
# the index and the working tree agree on every platform and clone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets must never be converted or diffed as text.
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
